    "Template for `create-clients-cosmos --l2-config` on AVALANCHE (C-Chain).",
    "Copy to avalanche-client-config.json (gitignored).",
    "",
    "The warp client's initial states carry live chain data (the pinned canonical",
    "validator set, the bootstrap block identity, and the router storage root at",
    "the header's settled height), so they are GENERATED, not hand-written:",
    "",
    "  cd tools/warp-spike && go run . -base-url <avalanche api> \\",
    "    -router <ICS26Router from the C-Chain deploy> -dump-bootstrap bootstrap.json",
    "",
    "then paste bootstrap.json's client_state/consensus_state under warp_bootstrap",
    "below. The values here are a 1-validator dummy so the shape is visible;",
    "create-clients re-checks the RPC's chain id against evm_chain_id before",
    "submitting. wasm_checksum comes from scripts/local/wasm_avax.sh."
